2 CONT Pr Joseph Franz Karl z Lobkowicz, Privy counsellor, cavalry general, nejvyšší hofmistr císařovny Alžběty, owned Dolní Beřkovice (Unterberkovic), *Wien 17.2.1803, +Praha 18.3.1875; 1m: Praha 20.8.1835 Gfn Antonie Kinsky von Wchinit
2 CONC z u.Tettau (*15.7.1815 +31.12.1835); 2m: Wien 11.5.1848 Pss Maria Sidonia von Lobkowicz (*4.10.1828 +25.2/10.1917); he had issue:
2 CONT * ...
2 CONT *A3. '''Maria AUGUST Georg Ferdinand, *Dolní Beřkovice 2.2.1862, +Wien 10.8.1921'''; m.Praha 3.10.1897 Gfn Irma Pálffy ab Erdöd, Frn von Ujezd (*29.10.1866 +14.7.1950)
2 CONT **B1. Maria EDUARD Joseph August Sidonius Johann Nepomuk Anton Aloys Kaspar, Captain of Czechoslovakian army, honorary Knight of Malta Order, *Schloß Hradiste nr Blovice 20.6.1899, +Freiburg im Br. 2.1.1959; m.Watch Hill, Rhode Is
2 CONC land 29.8.1925 Anita Lihme (*Pern, Illinois 4.11.1903, +New York 14.5.1976)
2 CONT *** ...
2 CONT **B2. Maria FERDINAND AUGUST Joseph Ignatius Anton Kunegundis Melchior, *Hodonín (Göding), Moravia 26.2.1901, +Frankfurt a.M. 7.12.1966; m.Waldfried bei Frankfurt 12.10.1932 Charlotte Peschel, adopted by Artur von Weinberg (*Frank
2 CONC furt a.M. 5.8.1896, +Frankfurt a.M. 24.9.1973)
2 CONT **B3. Maria Annunciata SIDONIA Sophia Augusta Antonia Ignatia Balthasara, *Hodonin (Göding) 25.3.1903, +Paris 22.4.1972
2 CONT * ...
