2 CONT Francesco Boncompagni Ludovisi (20 October 1886 – 7 June 1955) was an Italian politician. He was born in Foligno. He was the 3rd fascist governor of Rome from 1928 to 1935. He served in the Senate of the Kingdom of Italy. He died 
2 CONC in Rome, Italy.
