1 NOTE DUKE OF BRAGANZA
1 NOTE He was mortally wounded at the same time that his father was killed by a 
2 CONT bullet that severed his carotid artery, in the streets of Lisbon on 
2 CONT Febuary 1, 1908.  He was thus technically King of Portugal for about 20 
2 CONT minutes, which is the shortest reign of all time.
