1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://gw1.geneanet.org/frebault?lang=en;pz=henri;nz=frebault;ocz=0;p=charles+louis+francois+marie;n=de+merode gw1.geneanet.org...] ; 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00089920&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Charles-Louis, Prince de Merode, was born on 6 April 1948 in Bruxelles, the son of Albert, Prince de Merode, and Henriette de Vogüé. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 8 September 1974 in Opheylissem, Charles-Louis married Clotilde, Comtesse d'Oultremont, daughter of Adrien, Comte d'Oultremont, and Marie Blanche, Comtesse du Chastel de la Howarderie. They became the parents of three sons and 
2 CONC two daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles-Louis has been appointed as Knight of the Golden Fleece and installed as such at the Heilige Bloedbasiliek in Brugge, Belgium, on 30 November 2011.
